WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Find the main idea in a passage

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Identify the topic in a few words.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.640
Ask what the author wants you to understand about that topic.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:18.970
Test your sentence against the whole paragraph. A single example rarely covers the main idea.

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:29.100
In a passage about a school garden, tomatoes and spinach may be examples. The main idea could be that maintaining the garden teaches cooperation.
